<?xml version="1.0"?>
<info xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
      xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="https://apps.nextcloud.com/schema/apps/info.xsd">
    <id>chorestrike</id>
    <name>ChoreStrike</name>
    <summary>Gamified household task management - keep your home clean together!</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
ChoreStrike turns household chores into a fun, cooperative game.

**Features:**
- 🏠 Organize tasks by rooms and floors
- 📅 Smart scheduling with flexible planning options
- 🎯 Agreements, fair shares and recognized pauses
- 🏅 Rhythm medals and household weekly goals
- 👥 Multi-user support with opt-in weekly recognition
- 🌍 Multilingual (German, English, more to come)
- 📊 Track progress with House Health and room cleanliness

Complete agreed tasks, build a steady rhythm and keep your home tidy together. Perfect for families and roommates!
    ]]></description>

